    "description": "Developed a weather search website and an Android app which allows users to search for current weather and future predictions using Geocode and forecast.io RESTful APIs from Google.\nImplemented client-side with Angular 6 and Bootstrap for responsive web design.\nBuilt server-side deployed on AWS with node.js and employed AJAX and JSON for data communication.",
